                                "sense_id": "66fb8f51-c19f-3ede-9cee-c1eb769287b9",
                                "text": "The immoderate crebrity of the pulse is a sign of a syncope."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "71c0223b-681f-4be2-a30e-d3f766960726",
                                "sense_id": "66fb8f51-c19f-3ede-9cee-c1eb769287b9",
                                "text": "The two outward circles do not hinder the sight, but add much to the solemnity of the place and the duties, by the crebrity and variety of their intervals."
                            },
